WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:09,020
The thief Tang Lang dares to eat our B tribe’s rations

2
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:12,020
What kind of thief? I robbed it based on my ability.

3
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:18,680
A good person who relies on his ability. Do you think I, the B tribe, are weak and can be bullied?

4
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:20,680
I bullied you. What can you do?

5
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:23,680
When I, the Tang Lang Spirit Master, consulted, I was afraid that you would not succeed.

6
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:26,680
Are the Tanglang Clan going to war with my B Clan?

7
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:29,780
Even a small ant deserves to start a war

8
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:32,780
So brave. If you have the guts, just stay where you are and don't move.

9
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:35,780
The meat worms this time were a bit on the firewood and not plump enough.

10
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:41,500
Improve the technique and wait for me to taste it again in two days.

11
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,500
I want to destroy your Tanglang clan

12
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:11,470
Mom scared me to death

13
00:01:11,470 --> 00:01:13,470
Boss, you were discovered

14
00:01:13,470 --> 00:01:15,470
Noticed by their roar

15
00:01:15,470 --> 00:01:18,470
They still have Fei Yi. Let’s hide quickly.

16
00:01:18,470 --> 00:01:21,470
Songbao, who do we have behind us?

17
00:01:21,470 --> 00:01:23,920
The spiritual master consults

18
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:25,950
Mei Chi, you've crippled Mei Chi.

19
00:01:25,950 --> 00:01:26,950
He can help us

20
00:01:26,950 --> 00:01:28,950
It's not up to him

21
00:01:28,950 --> 00:01:31,950
Rest tonight, work on big things tomorrow

22
00:01:31,950 --> 00:01:35,170
Which American Tang wolf is calling a big deal?

23
00:01:35,170 --> 00:01:38,420
It's really hopeless
